--
-- MIB ref		: swCardEventLogSlotXX       .5.73.78.80.85.84
-- absolute OID	: 1.3.6.1.4.1.7995.2.6.1.1.XX.5.73.78.80.85.84
-- Vary			: YES
--
-- Value(s)		: LOST
--				: OK
-- Comments		: This log field shows the detected state of the SDI input signal.
--				: LOST indicates no input detected. 
--				: ERROR indicates that the detected input is not valid. 
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
